stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Queued
  Queued --> Running: worker picks up
  state Running {
    [*] --> Fetching
    Fetching --> Building: sources ready
    Building --> Testing
    Testing --> [*]
  }
  Running --> Succeeded: all checks pass
  Running --> Failed: step error
  Failed --> Queued: retry
  Running --> Cancelled: user cancels
  Succeeded --> [*]
  Cancelled --> [*]
